          "sectionId": 3910
        }
      ],
      "title": "#1 束手无策？"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "3920001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真田幸村",
          "text": "对不起！我……快要坚持不下去了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3920002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真田幸村",
          "text": "虽然说，男孩子总是要站在女孩子前面保护你们，但是，呃啊……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3920003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真田幸村",
          "text": "火焰的灼烧，让全身，都使不出力气呢！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3920004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "玲前辈…… ",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3920005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "请醒一醒，再……再坚持一下！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3920006",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "众手办被火焰包围之时，更多无辜的手办被「天启」生硬拖拽至流水线。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3920007",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "源源不断失去心智的「黑化」手办通过流水线生产出来，通过纸箱批量送往FULI商店，以完成货架上的偷天换日。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3920008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "和江……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3920009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "再冷静一点。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3920010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "我已经想到办法了，你们凑过来，仔细听好。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3920011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "像这样的机会，留给我们的，只有一次。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3920012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "如果失败……那也就意味着……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-208",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "exceldata",
          "rowIds": [
            3920001,
            3920002,
            3920003,
