          ],
          "sectionId": 3920
        }
      ],
      "title": "#2 见证"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "3930001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "集中心意，全身心投入……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3930002",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "因为这是我跟主人的承诺……是花迦所要坚守的，一切！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3930003",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "吕布",
          "text": "即使是火焰，也要射穿给你看！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3930004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真田幸村",
          "text": "好燃的场面！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3930005",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "真田幸村",
          "text": "用吾之长枪，夷平苍茫烈焰，这便是《赤炎·境界》！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3930006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "很好，火焰的蔓延有效的被遏制了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3930007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "优纪，接下来，我要你仔细集中精神。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3930008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "嗯，优纪明白。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3930009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "透过火焰，看到远处，那个不太瞩目的……容器了吗？如果我的猜测没错，这是工厂遗留的消防装置。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3930010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "用球棍瞄准，然后用力的将地上的碎石，击打过去吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3930011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "我……真的可以吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3930012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "我相信你，一定没问题的！就像……那个时候一样！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3930013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "嗯！就像那个时候一样！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-209",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "exceldata",
