      ],
      "title": "#3 全垒打"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "3940001",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "好厉害！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3940002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "白色的烟雾从喷口倾巢而出，被包围的火焰瞬间就无影无踪了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3940003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "和江！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3940004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "嗯！你做到了。我们做到了。\n又看到你的笑脸了，优纪，真开心呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3940005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3940006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "那个时候……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3940007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "如果能用这样的方法，是不是……是不是就……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3940008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "求求你，不要再执迷不悟下去了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3940009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "住嘴！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3940010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "怯懦的逃跑者，也敢妄议我？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3940011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "即便如此，那又怎样？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3940012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "我要你去直面，这些玩具自己的意志！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3940013",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "阿撒兹勒一声令下，黑化手办大军倾巢出动，平静的地面顿时变为涌动的地狱。",
          "type": "narration"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-210",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "exceldata",
          "rowIds": [
            3940001,
            3940002,
            3940003,
            3940004,
            3940005,
            3940006,
            3940007,
            3940008,
            3940009,
            3940010,
            3940011,
            3940012,
            3940013
          ],
          "sectionId": 3940
        }
      ],
      "title": "#4 扭曲的攻击"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "3950001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "就这样，跟暮色的地狱，融为一体。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3950002",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "呵呵……呵哈哈哈……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3950003",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "呵哈哈哈哈哈……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-211",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "exceldata",
          "rowIds": [
            3950001,
            3950002,
            3950003
          ],
          "sectionId": 3950
        }
      ],
      "title": "#5 盘旋"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "3960001",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "靠左！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3960002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真田幸村",
          "text": "嗯，多谢指点了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3960003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "优纪前辈！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3960004",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "嗯！瞄准，安打！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3960005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "喂喂！既然要玩怎么不带我一起！人家刚才，才、才没有昏迷呢！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3960006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "指哪打哪！欸嘿嘿……才、才怪！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3960007",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "黑化手办的进攻如同一股黑色奔涌的洪水。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3960008",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "但是，众手办的合力却像是洪水中逆流而上的一束光点！",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3960009",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "起先，光点在洪流中沉浮，被淹没，但又倔强的浮出水面。\n现在，奔涌狂化的洪水已经了无生机，只能在岸上，喘着最后一口粗气。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3960010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "复仇的时刻，终于来临了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3960011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "提尔",
          "text": "听从指挥官……主人的号召。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3960012",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "阿撒兹勒乘巨龙飞向流水线顶，当他用手抽出缺口处的长剑时，轰隆作响的履带轰然停止。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3960013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "那把大剑……竟然是……流水线启动的钥匙？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3960014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "那个……坠、坠饰……是……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3960015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "当我再次将主人的挚爱之物持在手心。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3960016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "这场复仇的黑夜，就注定不会停止！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3960017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "长久以来，一个穿行在黑夜中的复仇者。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3960018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "我会让FULI声名狼藉，我会摧毁所有FULI自以为是的，模型和玩具！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
